8
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Mei Lin: That's confirmed? Because the build currently has it defaulting to on.

9
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Priya Sharma: It's confirmed. Default off in production, on in staging. That's a hard requirement.

10
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Mei Lin: Okay, I'll raise a ticket to flip it.

11
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Raj Patel: Mm.

12
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Priya Sharma: Second. The order total on the confirmation page needs to include tax as a separate line item. Finance were very clear about that.

13
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Raj Patel: Separate line, not just in the total?

14
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Priya Sharma: Separate line. Subtotal, tax, delivery, then total.

15
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.000
Raj Patel: Got it. I'll take that one.

16
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Mei Lin: Do we know the tax rate is always twenty percent, or is it per region?

17
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:38.000
Priya Sharma: Good question. I don't actually know. Let me check with finance and come back.

18
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:42.000
Mei Lin: Okay.

19
00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:47.000
Raj Patel: While we're on checkout, should we look at the payment retry thing?

20
00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:52.000
Priya Sharma: Maybe. I'd like to but I don't think we have capacity this sprint.

21
00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:56.000
Raj Patel: Yeah, probably next one.

22
00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Priya Sharma: Let's park it. Not committing to it today.

23
00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:04.000
Mei Lin: Sounds right.

24
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:16.000
Priya Sharma: Third thing, and this one's mine. The regression suite has to run on every pull request before merge, not just nightly. That's non negotiable after last week.

25
00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Raj Patel: That's going to be slow. It's forty minutes.

26
00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:26.000
