29
00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:39.000
Priya Sharma: Hard number. If it doesn't hit fifteen we don't turn on the gate.

30
00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:43.000
Mei Lin: Understood.

31
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:47.000
Priya Sharma: Anything else? No? Right, I'll write this up.

32
00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:51.000
